# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback — every unknown path returns the SPA shell
# so React Router can handle client-side routes like /admin/conversations/123.
# Static assets (e.g. /assets/*.js, /assets/*.css) and the /api proxy
# (handled separately in CF Pages → Functions / Workers) are not affected.
/api/*  https://api.your-domain.com/api/:splat  200
/*      /index.html                           200
